  m_Name: Carta_AnaliseDeDados
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Metis.Runtime::KnowledgeEntryData
  _title: "An\xE1lise de Dados"
  _titleEn: Data Analysis
  _category: 0
  _unlockTrigger: 0
  _summary: "Cruzar os dados que a prefeitura j\xE1 tem ajuda a decidir onde agir
    primeiro, em vez de esperar a reclama\xE7\xE3o chegar."
  _summaryEn: Cross-referencing the data the city already has helps decide where
    to act first, instead of waiting for complaints to arrive.
  _realWorld: "Chicago passou a usar um modelo estat\xEDstico para escolher quais
    restaurantes inspecionar primeiro e publicou o c\xF3digo aberto do projeto; as
    infra\xE7\xF5es graves passaram a ser encontradas dias antes."
  _realWorldEn: Chicago began using a statistical model to choose which restaurants
    to inspect first and published the project's code openly; serious violations
    started being found days earlier.
  _tradeOffs: "Dados incompletos ou enviesados levam a decis\xF5es injustas, e a
    equipe t\xE9cnica para analisar custa caro."
  _tradeOffsEn: Incomplete or biased data leads to unfair decisions, and the technical
    staff to analyze it is expensive.
  _sources:
  - Label: Chicago, food-inspections-evaluation (GitHub)
    Url: https://github.com/Chicago/food-inspections-evaluation
